1734
01:30:32.340 --> 01:30:33.080
It's everything.

1735
01:30:33.920 --> 01:30:34.220
Yeah.

1736
01:30:34.760 --> 01:30:36.720
Well, I thought it was so great.

1737
01:30:36.720 --> 01:30:38.340
